{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  task 0003 (Task 8) — "Learn To Treat Soil As A Living System" (Education/Blog)
  ============================================================================
  Fully custom section — no native Horizon section does an article/guide-card grid with a
  floating icon badge over the image. Built from scratch per DXB's explicit request.

  NOTE: this comment deliberately never spells out the Liquid tag delimiters for the
  schema or stylesheet blocks below (plain words are used instead) — see the
  2026-09-06 lesson in this project's self_improve/LESSONS.md.

  WHAT THIS FILE NEEDS ALONGSIDE IT:
    - blocks/bfbella-article-card.liquid   (0003_task8_bfbella-article-card.liquid)
  Renders itself entirely — this section only does `{% content_for 'blocks' %}`.

  CONTENT: zero real copy hardcoded — heading, subheading, and every card field are blank
  native settings/block fields until DXB fills them in. See 0003_task8_howto.md for the
  exact production text (3 real guides) and where each piece goes.

  BLOG LINKS: production links each card to a Hydrogen route (`/article/{slug}`) backed by
  its own CMS, not Shopify's native blog system. This theme doesn't have a Shopify Blog set
  up with matching articles yet, so each card's link is a plain URL field — point it at a
  real Shopify blog article once one exists (Online Store → Blog posts), or leave it blank
  for a non-clickable card. See 0003_task8_howto.md.

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex.

  2026-09-07 — COLOR FIX: originally this section's background fell back to the ambient page
  background (via `var(--color-background)`) and its heading/subheading used
  `var(--color-foreground)` with no override setting — reasonable in isolation, but this
  theme's actual ambient background here is white, and the article-card block (see its own
  file) hardcoded WHITE card text assuming a dark backdrop, so the two combined made card text
  invisible. DXB worked around it by picking a green background manually, but the heading had
  no matching color control and stayed black-on-green. Fixed properly: `background_color`,
  `accent_color`, `heading_color`, and `subheading_color` are now real settings, each with a
  concrete native-palette default (not "ambient"/blank) so the section is legible with zero
  configuration, not just when DXB happens to override every field. Recommendation baked into
  the defaults: `color3` (green) background, white heading/subheading text, `color12` (a
  darker green — better contrast than `color8`/lime against the article cards' white
  background) for accent elements. See 0003_task8_color_fix_howto.md.

  DEPLOY: save as sections/bfbella-education.liquid in the live theme. DXB applies this —
  Claude never commits or touches the live repo.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color12
  assign bg = section.settings.background_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3
  assign heading_color = section.settings.heading_color | default: settings.color_palette.background
  assign subheading_color = section.settings.subheading_color | default: settings.color_palette.background

  render 'contrast-override', background_color: bg, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
%}

<div
  id="Education-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-education color-custom-{{ section.id }}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    --bfbella-bg: {{ bg }};
    --bfbella-heading-color: {{ heading_color }};
    --bfbella-subheading-color: {{ subheading_color }};
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
>
  <div class="bfbella-education__inner page-width">

    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <div class="bfbella-education__intro">
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="bfbella-education__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="bfbella-education__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="bfbella-education__grid">
        {% content_for 'blocks' %}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-education {
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 5rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 5rem);
    background-color: var(--bfbella-bg);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bfbella-education__inner {
    max-width: 80rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-education__intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block-end: 4rem;
  }

  .bfbella-education__heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
    color: var(--bfbella-heading-color);
  }

  .bfbella-education__subheading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--bfbella-subheading-color);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .bfbella-education__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — Education",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "bfbella-article-card"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "Heading color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Leave blank for white — reads correctly against the default green background below."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "subheading_color",
      "label": "Subheading color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Leave blank to match Heading color (rendered at reduced opacity)."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Accent color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Used for icon badges, the read-time label, and the \"Read guide\" link — these sit on the article cards' own (usually white) background, not this section's. Leave blank to use the theme's color12 (a darker green) swatch, chosen for contrast against white cards — the original color8 (lime) reads poorly there."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Leave blank to use the theme's color3 (brand green) swatch — recommended. The section previously defaulted to the ambient page background (white), which made the article cards' text unreadable; this default fixes that without requiring you to set anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "BFBella — Education",
      "category": "Custom",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "bfbella-article-card" },
        { "type": "bfbella-article-card" },
        { "type": "bfbella-article-card" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
